"上榜排序怎么算" = "How the ranking is scored";
"综合分 = 35% 类型确定性 + 30% 强弱 + 35% 新鲜度，最新一天命中「共振」再额外加分。" = "Score = 35% type certainty + 30% strength + 35% freshness, with a bonus for hitting \"Aligned\" on the latest day.";
"类型确定性：一类 0.4（背驰迹象，待验证）、二类 0.7（回踩不破中枢）、三类 1.0（完全不回中枢，最强确认）。" = "Type certainty: type 1 = 0.4 (a divergence hint, unconfirmed), type 2 = 0.7 (pullback holds the pivot), type 3 = 1.0 (pullback never re-enters the pivot — the strongest confirmation).";
"每类买卖点先保底最多 2 个名额，其余按综合分从高到低补满，共取前 10 名。" = "Each signal type gets up to 2 guaranteed slots first; the rest are filled by score, for a top-10 list overall.";
"以上打分口径与详情页强弱、确认状态判定完全一致，只是气泡取的是某一次扫描的快照。" = "This scoring matches the same strength and confirmation logic used on the analysis detail page — the bubbles just reflect a snapshot from one scan.";
"为什么点进详情页可能对不上" = "Why the detail page can look different";
"气泡是最近一次全量扫描那一刻的快照（历史日期下方会标出算出时刻），不是实时数据；点进详情页是用当下最新K线重新跑一遍缠论。" = "Bubbles are a snapshot from the last full scan (the computed time is shown under past dates), not live data; opening the detail page reruns the Chan analysis on the latest candles.";
"缠论的笔和买卖点在最新几根K线上本身是临时性的，后续新K线一出现，原来某天的信号可能被延伸、改写甚至判定失效——这是分析方法的特性，不是数据错误。" = "Chan strokes and signals near the most recent candles are inherently provisional — once new candles arrive, a signal from an earlier day can be extended, rewritten, or invalidated. That's how the method works, not a data error.";
"越靠近「今天」的气泡越可能受影响；对某个信号有疑问，以点进详情页当下重新算出的结构为准。" = "Bubbles closer to \"today\" are more likely to be affected; if a signal looks off, trust the structure recomputed live on the detail page.";
"正在刷新买卖点信号…" = "Refreshing signals…";
"确认买卖点" = "Signal confirmed";
"确认买卖点之后，后续同方向的笔里出现了背驰——创新高/新低，但价差、量能或时长比前一个同向段更弱。交付物：一买或一卖信号，强弱由这三项的比值决定。" = "After the signal is confirmed, a later stroke in the same direction shows divergence — a new high/low, but with a weaker price range, volume, or duration than the prior same-direction leg. Output: a type-1 buy/sell signal, with strength set by those three ratios.";
"确认买卖点之后，继续沿同一方向前进的笔里，力度（价差/量能/时长）比前一个同向段更弱，判定为「背驰」。" = "After the signal is confirmed, a stroke continuing in the same direction shows weaker force (price range/volume/duration) than the prior same-direction leg — that's judged as \"divergence.\"";
"离开中枢之后的回踩笔，收在越过原边界处（三类）或区间内但未破对侧边界（二类），判定为「确认买卖点」。" = "The retrace stroke after leaving the pivot closes beyond the original boundary (type-3) or inside the range without breaking the opposite boundary (type-2) — that's judged as \"signal confirmed.\"";
"「确认买卖点」或「背驰/转折」之后，后面出现一次方向相反、同样满足突破+回踩条件的新尝试——整体重新判定一次，结论会被新结果直接覆盖。" = "After \"signal confirmed\" or \"divergence / turn,\" a later attempt in the opposite direction also satisfies the breakout + retrace conditions — the whole judgment reruns from scratch, and the new result directly overrides the previous conclusion.";
"切换指数范围" = "Switch index";
"「%@」首次计算较久" = "First computation of \"%@\" takes a while";
"大盘成分较多，已在后台计算，稍后点重试即可查看" = "This broad index has many constituents and is being computed in the background. Tap Retry in a moment to view it.";
"没有信号不代表没有风险。可返回「当前状态」查看中枢位置和下一步观察。" = "No signal doesn't mean no risk. Go back to \"Current State\" to check the pivot position and what to watch next.";
"深浅=形态强弱" = "Shade = strength";
"大小=一二三类" = "Size = type 1/2/3";
"颜色：红=买点，绿=卖点；深浅=形态强弱（弱/中/强），越强越深，与详情页同一套判定。" = "Color: red = buy, green = sell; shade = pattern strength (weak/medium/strong) — stronger is darker, judged the same way as on the detail page.";
"大小：买卖点类型，一类最小、三类最大——越往后确认程度越高。" = "Size: signal type — type 1 smallest, type 3 largest; later types are more confirmed.";
"新鲜度：按信号出现后的交易日数算（周末、休市不算），当天最高，5 个交易日（一周）后归零并退场。" = "Freshness: counted in trading days since the signal appeared (weekends and holidays excluded) — highest on the day, reaching zero after 5 trading days (a week), when the signal leaves the board.";
"未确认的信号（落在最后一笔上的提前预判）：类型确定性和强弱两部分打 6 折，新鲜度不打折。" = "Unconfirmed signals (early calls on the last, still-open stroke): the type-certainty and strength parts are discounted to 60%; freshness is not.";
"价格走坏即退场：信号出现后，收盘价跌破买点价位（卖点：涨破）就判定失效，当天起不再上榜。" = "Invalidation: once the close falls below a buy signal's price (or rises above a sell signal's), the signal is treated as failed and leaves the board from that day.";
"气泡多久更新一次" = "How often bubbles update";
"当前数据：%@ 全量计算，共振标记 %@ 更新。" = "Current data: full scan at %@; resonance tags updated at %@.";
"当前数据：%@ 全量计算。" = "Current data: full scan at %@.";
"全量重扫：每个交易日收盘后约 45 分钟重算全部气泡（等行情源发布当天日线），按你的时区约为 美股 %@、A股 %@、港股 %@。盘中当天日线还没定型，不做全量重扫。" = "Full rescan: about 45 minutes after each market closes on trading days (once the day's candle is published) — in your time zone roughly US %@, A-shares %@, Hong Kong %@. No full rescan intraday, since the day's candle isn't final yet.";
"盘中：每 30 分钟刷新一次最新一天的「共振」标记（日线方向 × 30 分钟买卖点），气泡位置和大小不变。" = "Intraday: the latest day's \"resonance\" tags (daily direction × 30-minute signals) refresh every 30 minutes; bubble positions and sizes stay the same.";
"自动补算：服务重启后会先补扫一轮；数据过旧时，你打开本页也会在后台重算，期间先显示上一次的结果。" = "Auto catch-up: after a server restart a scan runs right away; if the data is stale, opening this page triggers a background rescan while the previous result stays on screen.";
"点进详情页是当下实时计算（不用缓存），盘中与气泡快照可能有出入，以详情页为准。" = "The detail page is computed live (no cache), so intraday it may differ from the bubble snapshot — the detail page is the reference.";
